    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ccef40b2eb1238c4",
      "translationZh": "Nunchaku Lite 入门",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2913f93d0f915f5d",
      "translationZh": "首先，安装所需依赖。你需要较新版本的 Diffusers 和 Hugging Face kernels 包：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a028da707bee286",
      "translationZh": "然后，像加载其他 Diffusers 模型一样，加载一个预量化的流水线：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d8a185a58897d53",
      "translationZh": "无需自定义流水线类或单独的推理引擎，也无需在本地编译任何内容。首次使用时，NVFP4 内核会通过 Nunchaku Lite kernels 页面从 Hub 下载。这个检查点将 Nunchaku NVFP4 transformer 与 bitsandbytes NF4 文本编码器配对使用，在 RTX 5090 上生成一张 1024x1024 图像约需 1.7 秒，峰值内存占用约为 12 GB，而 BF16 流水线约为 24 GB。关于 Nunchaku Lite 检查点格式的更多细节，可参阅 Diffusers 官方文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc41436f5542b57c",
      "translationZh": "NVFP4 检查点需要 NVIDIA Blackwell GPU（RTX 50 series、RTX PRO 6000、B200）。对于更早的硬件代际，请使用 INT4 变体。详情请参阅下方的硬件支持表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f4c181eb374b2c50",
      "translationZh": "背景：SVDQuant 和 Nunchaku",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "906905d6f637d45d",
      "translationZh": "SVDQuant 是 Nunchaku 背后的量化方法，Nunchaku 则是其参考 CUDA 推理引擎。对于扩散 transformer，标准的 4 位量化很困难，因为权重和激活值都包含较大的离群值。SVDQuant 通过将激活值中的离群值转移到权重中，用一个小型的 16 位低秩分支表示每个权重矩阵中最难量化的部分，并将剩余残差量化为 4 位来解决这个问题。Nunchaku 通过用于 4 位路径和低秩分支的融合内核，让这一过程得以高效运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e70b8e6e6667541b",
      "translationZh": "Nunchaku 将低秩降维投影与量化内核融合，并将低秩升维投影与 4 位计算内核融合，从而消除 16 位分支的内存访问开销。图片来自 SVDQuant 论文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "423254a4f49de94b",
      "translationZh": "介绍 Nunchaku Lite",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "559f31f1f9673ef1",
      "translationZh": "原版 Nunchaku 引擎的速度优势很大程度上来自针对特定模型的融合执行路径，例如融合 QKV 投影和融合 GELU/MLP 内核。这些优化与各架构的模块布局和检查点格式紧密相关，因此，支持新的模型系列通常需要进行针对该模型的集成工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "019312a5feb2bbf7",
      "translationZh": "Nunchaku Lite 是 Diffusers 中新的集成方式。借助它，Diffusers 无需自定义流水线或独立的推理引擎，即可加载 Nunchaku 风格的检查点。在底层，Nunchaku Lite 会在加载检查点之前，用运行时 SVDQ/AWQ 线性层替换标准 Diffusers 模型中相关的 nn.Linear 模块。CUDA 内核通过 kernels 包从 Hub 获取。它使用两类内核：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "adb712bc25eeadf6",
      "translationZh": "svdq_w4a4：4 位权重和激活值，配合 SVDQuant 低秩校正。该层用于 transformer 的注意力和 MLP 投影，几乎所有计算开销都集中在这些部分，并提供 INT4 和 NVFP4 两种变体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "355dfaf40db36e24",
      "translationZh": "awq_w4a16：4 位权重配合 16 位激活值，用于自适应归一化和调制投影，例如 FLUX 的 adanorm_single / adanorm_zero 或 Qwen-Image 的调制层。这些层受内存带宽限制，且对精度敏感，因此 AWQ 很适合在节省内存和存储空间的同时保持精度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b31c21a45e55b968",
      "translationZh": "代价是，由于没有针对特定架构的融合内核和模块，Nunchaku Lite 无法达到原版 Nunchaku 引擎的加速幅度。不过，这一精简实现仍能带来约 30% 的加速，同时保持相同程度的显存占用降低。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2763f14d4a2a3350",
      "translationZh": "在 Diffusers 中原生加载",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1bcd0e8f30cdfc7",
      "translationZh": "如果你在 Diffusers 中使用过 bitsandbytes 或 torchao，就会觉得这套机制很熟悉。Nunchaku Lite 模型仓库就是一个普通的 Diffusers 仓库。唯一特殊之处是 transformer 的 config.json 中有一个 quantization_config 配置块：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f6b785668baf0b8",
      "translationZh": "这项配置会告诉 Diffusers 哪些模块经过了量化、它们使用哪种方案，以及应实例化哪种 Nunchaku Lite 运行时层（SVDQW4A4Linear 或 AWQW4A16Linear）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ccefe2de96b743f",
      "translationZh": "由于量化模型保留了与稠密模型完全相同的模块结构，所有下游组件和功能（调度器、LoRA 加载钩子、卸载、torch.compile）看到的都是一个普通的 Diffusers 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f3b000a5616e2ff9",
      "translationZh": "硬件支持",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69dcd43faef57dd0",
      "translationZh": "Nunchaku Lite 根据 GPU 代际和检查点精度使用不同的内核变体：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dca65687b97af5d9",
      "translationZh": "方案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5d65f0ae389b602",
      "translationZh": "精度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66a0f23410f70aef",
      "translationZh": "支持的 GPU",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c32f222c557d36f3",
      "translationZh": "Blackwell（RTX 50 系列、RTX PRO 6000、B200）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b31a0e77086ba4b",
      "translationZh": "Turing / Ampere / Ada（RTX 30 和 40 系列、A100、L40S）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b31a0e77086ba4b",
      "translationZh": "Turing / Ampere / Ada（RTX 30 和 40 系列、A100、L40S）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4b3f3f15d086759",
      "translationZh": "4 位内核目前不支持 Volta 和 Hopper GPU。量化器会在加载时验证 GPU 的 CUDA 计算能力，并在不支持时抛出明确的错误，而不是产生错误的输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c7928020fbc618ae",
      "translationZh": "进一步提速并降低内存占用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1cc79a78eabb9cd9",
      "translationZh": "Nunchaku Lite 可以与 Diffusers 的其他内存和速度优化措施结合使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc2cabcd2fdde02b",
      "translationZh": "torch.compile。编译 transformer 可将端到端加速比从 1.35x 提升至 1.8x：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae82abaa7487bcf9",
      "translationZh": "量化文本编码器。transformer 并不是唯一占用大量内存的组件。T5 或 Qwen3 等文本编码器本身就可能占用数 GB 内存。在我们的基准测试中，使用 bitsandbytes NF4 进一步量化文本编码器，可使峰值显存占用降低约 22%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "666c86f745e70aeb",
      "translationZh": "卸载。如果需要让流水线能在显存更小的 GPU 上运行，Diffusers 的卸载辅助方法（如 enable_model_cpu_offload() 和 enable_sequential_cpu_offload()）仍可照常使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9f2e7732a6956e5b",
      "translationZh": "基准测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ffb6fc9fbf969a42",
      "translationZh": "以下所有数据均在 NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000 (Blackwell) 上，以 1024x1024 分辨率使用 rootonchair/ERNIE-Image-Turbo-nunchaku-lite-int4-bnb4-text-encoder 测得。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
