      "translationZh": "1.35 倍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c20af106ac8757b8",
      "translationZh": "1.68 秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0885000ad65ca8f3",
      "translationZh": "1.53 秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6a88bf84d353456",
      "translationZh": "1.8 倍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "410c2d681117ad2c",
      "translationZh": "Nunchaku Lite NVFP4 + NF4 文本编码器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48d1a35495a562c9",
      "translationZh": "2.29 秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab5bfb9d14a57ea1",
      "translationZh": "2.13 秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23e3a04cb0126818",
      "translationZh": "1.35 倍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64ac6e344ec6b6e0",
      "translationZh": "如上所示，Nunchaku 将峰值显存占用降低了高达 50%，同时仍将延迟改善了约 30%。剩余开销主要来自额外的内核启动，torch.compile 可以缓解这一问题，将完整流水线的耗时降至 1.68 秒，即速度达到 BF16 基线的 1.8x。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6ad454c2ce8e9c39",
      "translationZh": "图像质量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e5f009d3b4a3d33",
      "translationZh": "在相同种子和设置下，BF16 与 4-bit 输出的对比。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7d7cc3c8bac82a96",
      "translationZh": "量化你自己的模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8666340e2fbf3de1",
      "translationZh": "Diffusers 中的 Nunchaku Lite 支持与架构无关，而 diffuse-compressor 工具包为 Diffusers 模型提供了端到端的 SVDQuant 工作流程：校准、量化、打包和发布。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ae21e077e6b0367",
      "translationZh": "下面，我们以 FLUX.2 Klein 4B 为例，逐步介绍量化过程。其中涵盖了主要步骤：检查模型，校准并量化 transformer，将结果打包为 Diffusers 流水线，然后验证并推送到 Hub。完整教程会详细介绍每个标志参数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a6fc9b23cca5cd76",
      "translationZh": "1. 检查将要量化的内容",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86cb4e4ba719bac9",
      "translationZh": "通用扫描器遍历模型并确定量化目标：重复堆叠的 transformer 块中兼容的线性层成为 SVDQ W4A4 目标，识别出的调制线性层成为 AWQ W4A16 目标，其余所有层保持为稠密形式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb1c519003b22b6e",
      "translationZh": "量化前务必阅读这份报告。对于 FLUX.2 Klein 4B，预期结果为 100 个 SVDQ 目标、3 个 AWQ 目标和 6 个稠密的外部线性层，且没有缺失的模式或重复的名称。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6f0b4c76cabbf0f6",
      "translationZh": "2. 运行量化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88c0fc79fcde1b90",
      "translationZh": "以下命令对 transformer 运行 SVDQuant，并将量化后的检查点写入 outputs/checkpoints/svdq-int4_r32-flux-2-klein-4b.safetensors：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb43b28e5acdf84e",
      "translationZh": "将 --precision int4 替换为 nvfp4，以构建 Blackwell 原生权重。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "185b5e1dc642eb5d",
      "translationZh": "3. 打包 Diffusers 流水线",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "735dbffbf8c1f3ce",
      "translationZh": "转换器将量化后的 transformer 与基础流水线的其他组件组合起来，将精简的 nunchaku_lite 配置写入 transformer/config.json，并且可以选择将文本编码器转换为 NF4：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b99550e4a105b056",
      "translationZh": "4. 加载、验证并推送到 Hub",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "626354ff222f8ee6",
      "translationZh": "确认输出效果良好后，运行 pipe.push_to_hub(\"your-name/your-model-nunchaku-lite-int4\")。随后，其他用户就可以使用上面展示的相同 from_pretrained() 方式加载它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9ee1325a96d591f9",
      "translationZh": "对需要结构重写的模型进行量化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "27bfb6b8bc6e3145",
      "translationZh": "请注意，通用路径假定该架构无需结构重写即可量化。为了进一步加速，原版 Nunchaku 引擎会将多组 Diffusers 层重写为融合模块。通用路径无法自行推断这些变化，例如将独立的 Q、K 和 V 投影合并为一个模块，或将一个融合投影拆分到多个模块中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfa18ffbdeee0ba1",
      "translationZh": "FLUX.1-dev 的 QKV 投影就是一个具体示例。Diffusers 定义了三个独立模块：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b685edf045917424",
      "translationZh": "Nunchaku FLUX 模块将这些层合并为一个量化的 to_qkv 模块：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "224e3dc052d0c70d",
      "translationZh": "之所以需要这个分组模块，是因为 Nunchaku 的融合算子会一起处理 QKV 投影、Q/K 归一化和旋转位置嵌入。相比之下，默认的 Diffusers 路径会分别执行这些操作：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aae050adb1fcbb98",
      "translationZh": "Nunchaku 路径将分组投影、归一化模块和旋转位置嵌入提供给一个融合算子：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e003584bebc03bd",
      "translationZh": "这就是通用路径无法推断的结构重写。Diffusers 有三个目标模块，其参数前缀分别为 to_q、to_k 和 to_v，而 Nunchaku 在 to_qkv 下只有一个分组模块。模型专用的目标配置或适配器必须明确指定：Q、K 和 V 参数应按此顺序沿输出维度拼接，并加载到 to_qkv 中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3043fcf3e43789c7",
      "translationZh": "这类结构重写在量化过程中由模型专用的目标配置描述，并在加载检查点时由一个小型运行时适配器处理。FLUX.2 Klein 4B 量化脚本提供了一个具体的目标配置示例，用于生成经过结构重写的检查点；而 rootonchair/nunchaku-lite 则提供了加载分组 QKV 张量、拆分融合投影以及处理其他融合操作所需的运行时适配器。完整工作流程可参阅《Adding A New Model》指南。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dca2672afbea0eac",
      "translationZh": "开箱即用的检查点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8030d7b80492452",
      "translationZh": "要立即上手，请查看以下仓库：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9da0b263f3a850ae",
      "translationZh": "rootonchair/ERNIE-Image-Turbo-nunchaku-lite-int4-bnb4-text-encoder：配备 bitsandbytes NF4 文本编码器的 INT4 ERNIE-Image-Turbo",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "535e1419cff8d15c",
      "translationZh": "rootonchair/ERNIE-Image-Turbo-nunchaku-lite-nvfp4-bnb4-text-encoder：配备 bitsandbytes NF4 文本编码器的 NVFP4 ERNIE-Image-Turbo",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6b36f8b65b935b61",
      "translationZh": "OzzyGT/Krea_2_Turbo_nunchaku_lite_nvfp4：NVFP4 Krea 2 Turbo 检查点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7f456f544a680692",
      "translationZh": "lite-infer：更多 Nunchaku Lite 检查点和合集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "306cd05caadcba54",
      "translationZh": "Nunchaku 的 SVDQuant 内核是在消费级硬件上高效运行扩散 Transformer 的最有效方式之一，如今已获得 Diffusers 的原生支持。预量化检查点可通过 from_pretrained() 加载，而 diffuse-compressor 工具包使得无需等待引擎支持即可量化新架构。通过同时量化权重和激活值，W4A4 路径在降低内存使用量的同时缩短了去噪延迟，并使图像质量保持接近 BF16 原版的水平。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d58da6260d1acf8f",
      "translationZh": "如果你量化并发布了一个新模型，我们很想了解它。欢迎在 Hub 上分享，并告诉我们！如果你对这项功能有任何疑问，欢迎加入我们的 Discord。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19a47a22285dac65",
      "translationZh": "如需了解更多信息，请查看以下资源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
